# clients.txt — machine clients B2B / client_credentials (NOT versioned)
#
# Format:
#   client_id:client_secret:scope1,scope2
#
# - client_id: [A-Za-z0-9._-] max 64 (e.g. billing-svc)
# - client_secret: high entropy in prod (openssl rand -base64 32).
#   Hashed with salt on load; never logged. Unlike userbase.txt, the plain
#   secret is never uploaded anywhere (bootstrap uploads hashes only).
# - scopes: comma/space separated. Minimum for the file API: files.read
#
# Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Examples:
# svc-billing:REPLACE_WITH_SECRET:files.read
# svc-etl:REPLACE_WITH_SECRET:files.read

svc-demo:dev-secret-change-me:files.read
